Thanks Devin. It is correct (and known) that reverse-order for loops are not supported for compilation.

I checked our User Manual to see how well this is documented. I see in a couple of places we state that for loops only support sequential integer indexing, but evidently we don't also say that it must be increasing sequential integer indexing.

Perry

